{"3884300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fire & Light: Thrones of Tyberion", "steam_appid": 3884300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Note to Heroes</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This game is developed with your feedback, which you can send directly from the game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/18f7e82f056a6ad60565bcb0603687ab.avif?t=1776197098\" width=780 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adam created you to find Eve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eve has fallen</strong> from Paradise, Adam created you to go <strong>find her.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But since the Great Flood on Tyberion, the <i>Light</i> has been called into question... the masters of <i>Fire</i> have seized power! Heroes... the coming of the Divine Child is in your hands, will you honor your oath? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you jump into Tyberion to find Eve... or to rule it, and defy the divinities who created you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/52d34dd2034d535b92903885ff8df155.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/52d34dd2034d535b92903885ff8df155.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/52d34dd2034d535b92903885ff8df155.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your Hero and jump into Tyberion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fire &amp; Light: Thrones of Tyberion</u> is a fast-paced rogue-survivor in which you can sit down to rule over the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/e16357b46a3b83aa8ef4a74ddd45a2f2.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/e16357b46a3b83aa8ef4a74ddd45a2f2.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/e16357b46a3b83aa8ef4a74ddd45a2f2.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sigils &amp; power items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight with a sigil drawn on the ground. Each time you level up, choose a new power item that will be added to your arsenal... some trigger with your main attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d0391b89c55f4a7418836d1d8a4d60dc.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d0391b89c55f4a7418836d1d8a4d60dc.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d0391b89c55f4a7418836d1d8a4d60dc.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Multiple Heroes to discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero can walk, run, dodge, attack, and even launch a special attack that lets you wipe out an entire wave of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/27687b97c31127c8606506b374cf5057.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/27687b97c31127c8606506b374cf5057.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/27687b97c31127c8606506b374cf5057.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sit down to rule!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruling phases increase the frequency of all your attacks, don't hesitate to abuse them! Some thrones even have bonus powers attached!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8abcdc9670a19e31ba7340bb60a4907f.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8abcdc9670a19e31ba7340bb60a4907f.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8abcdc9670a19e31ba7340bb60a4907f.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">As above, so below.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Fire &amp; Light Stigmata, to manifest new monuments and events in Paradise that will appear during your runs in Tyberion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/73031b59743f683231139f880c996969.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/73031b59743f683231139f880c996969.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/73031b59743f683231139f880c996969.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Multiply your powers with artifacts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your powers will become stronger if you stack them, or if you find an artifact compatible with one of its attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/718594b8367013302610f48c0de4797f.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/718594b8367013302610f48c0de4797f.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/718594b8367013302610f48c0de4797f.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dethrone the masters of Fire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome is guarded by a fearsome boss, whom you must defeat to access the next level. Once the boss is beaten, loot them... or recruit them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d98fd5e07a19dbc5782e01ac97fca6ed.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d98fd5e07a19dbc5782e01ac97fca6ed.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d98fd5e07a19dbc5782e01ac97fca6ed.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A clash between Fire and Light</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack Fire and Light Stigmata to gain unfair advantages in exchange for more stress, or balance both energies to find peace. Beware, the more you break the balance between Fire and Light, the more special creatures like Verminables or Immortals will appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c048a325982bda7364e6b82b2beada9c.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c048a325982bda7364e6b82b2beada9c.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c048a325982bda7364e6b82b2beada9c.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">To choose is to betray.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo of Fire &amp; Light: Thrones of 