ragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dethrone the masters of Fire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome is guarded by a fearsome boss, whom you must defeat to access the next level. Once the boss is beaten, loot them... or recruit them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d98fd5e07a19dbc5782e01ac97fca6ed.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d98fd5e07a19dbc5782e01ac97fca6ed.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/d98fd5e07a19dbc5782e01ac97fca6ed.mp4?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A clash between Fire and Light</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack Fire and Light Stigmata to gain unfair advantages in exchange for more stress, or balance both energies to find peace. Beware, the more you break the balance between Fire and Light, the more special creatures like Verminables or Immortals will appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c048a325982bda7364e6b82b2beada9c.poster.avif?t=1776197098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c048a325982bda7364e6b82b2beada9c.webm?t=1776197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c048a325982bda7364e6b82b2beada9c.mp4?t=1776197098\